{
  "declaredLength": 2012,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "我叫多连安，\n是个独立游戏制作人。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 292,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EB591A8FDE5B89FF0C000A662F4E2A72EC7ACB6E38620F52364F5C4EBA300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我尤其熟悉多边形的东西。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 336,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115C245176719F6089591A8FB95F6276844E1C897F300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你知道我说的多边形的东西\n是指什么吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6077E5905362118BF47684591A8FB95F6276844E1C897F000A662F63074EC04E485417FF1F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝可梦的多边兽？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 420,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B9D53EF68A67684591A8FB9517DFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "3D建模的多边形？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 440,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "003300445EFA6A217684591A8FB95F62FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "某种意义上也算是答对了。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67D079CD610F4E494E0A4E5F7B97662F7B545BF94E86300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没错！我刚才想说的\n就是3D计算机图形的<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n那个多边形啦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA19519FF016211521A624D60F38BF47684000A5C31662F003300448BA17B97673A56FE5F62768400100001BE00000A90A34E2A591A8FB95F625566300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你平时玩的游戏里的那些立体角色，\n也就是人们常说的模型……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605E7365F673A976846E38620F91CC768490A34E9B7ACB4F5389D28272FF0C000A4E5F5C31662F4EBA4EEC5E388BF476846A21578B2026202600100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它们都是基于一种名叫\n多边形建模的原理呈现出来的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B834EEC90FD662F57FA4E8E4E0079CD540D53EB000A591A8FB95F625EFA6A217684539F7406544873B051FA67657684300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所谓的多边形建模，\n就是在3D空间里把多边形<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n组合起来，做成想要的形状。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62408C137684591A8FB95F625EFA6A21FF0C000A5C31662F5728003300447A7A95F491CC628A591A8FB95F6200100001BE00000A7EC454088D776765FF0C505A621060F3898176845F6272B6300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "使用的多边形越多，\n模型就会越平滑。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F7F75287684591A8FB95F628D8A591AFF0C000A6A21578B5C314F1A8D8A5E736ED1300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但在以前，多边形用得太多会处理不过来，\n所以当时的模型都是棱角分明的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 832,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4657284EE5524DFF0C591A8FB95F6275285F97592A591A4F1A590474064E0D8FC76765FF0C000A62404EE55F5365F676846A21578B90FD662F68F189D25206660E7684300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多边兽这只宝可梦据说也是\n基于当时最先进技术的产物，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但毕竟技术是会进步的嘛。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "591A8FB9517D8FD953EA5B9D53EF68A6636E8BF44E5F662F000A57FA4E8E5F5365F6670051488FDB6280672F76844EA77269FF0C00100001BE00000A4F466BD57ADF6280672F662F4F1A8FDB6B657684561B300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "说到这里，我想请你帮个忙。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1008,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8BF452308FD991CCFF0C621160F38BF74F605E2E4E2A5FD9300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "用你的多边兽和\n我的多边兽交换吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75284F607684591A8FB9517D548C000A62117684591A8FB9517D4EA463625427FF0100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你愿意用你的多边兽\n和我的多边兽交换吗？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60613F610F75284F607684591A8FB9517D000A548C62117684591A8FB9517D4EA463625417FF1F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我愿意交换！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211613F610F4EA46362FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还是算了",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD8662F7B974E860000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我们来一起享受多边兽换多边兽的\n超级无敌激动人心的美妙时光嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114EEC67654E008D774EAB53D7591A8FB9517D6362591A8FB9517D7684000A8D857EA765E0654C6FC052A84EBA5FC376847F8E599965F65149561BFF0100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那就用你的多边兽\n和我的多边兽交换吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1252,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A35C3175284F607684591A8FB9517D000A548C62117684591A8FB9517D4EA463625427FF0100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "就用你的多边兽和\n我的多边兽交换嘛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C3175284F607684591A8FB9517D548C000A62117684591A8FB9517D4EA46362561BFF0100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是多边兽啦！\n我想交换的是多边兽啦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F591A8FB9517D5566FF01000A621160F34EA463627684662F591A8FB9517D5566300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "……哦！？\n滑滑的样子……！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "2026202654E6FF01FF1F000A6ED16ED1768468375B5020262026FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这是我给你的小惊喜哦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9662F62117ED94F6076845C0F60CA559C54E6300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我让传送给你的那只多边兽\n携带了升级数据。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118BA94F2090017ED94F60768490A353EA591A8FB9517D000A643A5E264E8653477EA76570636E300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以它就这样进化成\n多边兽2型啦。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE55B835C318FD968378FDB53166210000A591A8FB9517D0032578B5566300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你看！它的身体变得更平滑了对吧？\n从这点就可以看出处理性能的提升。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1556,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60770BFF015B8376848EAB4F5353D85F9766F45E736ED14E865BF95427FF1F000A4ECE8FD970B95C3153EF4EE5770B51FA59047406602780FD768463D05347300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然它在版本升级后搭载了人工智能，\n还安装了行星开发程序，但是……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1632,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D71365B8357287248672C53477EA7540E642D8F7D4E864EBA5DE5667A80FDFF0C000A8FD85B8988C54E86884C661F5F0053D17A0B5E8FFF0C4F46662F2026202600100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它仍然是一只非常需要照顾的宝可梦，\n而正是它的这一点让我爱到无法自拔。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B834ECD7136662F4E0053EA975E5E38970089817167987E76845B9D53EF68A6FF0C000A800C6B63662F5B8376848FD94E0070B98BA962117231523065E06CD581EA62D4300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦？\n这光芒难道是……<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF1F000A8FD95149829296BE9053662F2026202600100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "原来你也让多边兽\n携带了升级数据啊。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "539F67654F604E5F8BA9591A8FB9517D000A643A5E264E8653477EA76570636E554A300200100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这毫无疑问就是你给我的惊喜！\n能有这么愉快的宝可梦交换，真是太感谢了！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD96BEB65E0759195EE5C31662F4F607ED96211768460CA559CFF01000A80FD67098FD94E4861095FEB76845B9D53EF68A64EA46362FF0C771F662F592A611F8C224E86FF0100100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "多边兽2型\n能不能再升一级呢？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔƯ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "591A8FB9517D0032578B000A80FD4E0D80FD518D53474E007EA75462FF1F00100002011401AF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "哆哔哔。",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2000,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54C654D454D430020000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    }
  ],
